CSS
section {
 display: flex;
 align-items: start;
 justify-content: space-around;
}
article {
 display: inline-block;
 width: 40%;
}
h1 {
 font-size: 1.2em;
}
h2 {
 font-size: 1em;
 color: rgb(150 149 149);
}
h3 {
 font-size: 0.9em;
